<title>UK: GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 36-hole</p>
<p>final in the World Matchplay championship on the West Course at</p>
<p>Wentworth on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Ernie Els (South Africa) beat Vijay Singh (Fiji) 3 and 2</p>
<p>Third place playoff (18 holes)</p>
<p>4-Mark Brooks (U.S.) beat 2-Tom Lehman (U.S.) by one hole.</p>
